(7169795, 1100456, 37392, '<td valign="top">minimalist?</td>', 'minimalist?', '2014-02-05 00:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169798, 1101499, 112828, '<td valign="top">LOST!</td>', 'LOST!', '2014-02-05 00:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169799, 1101370, 108069, '<td valign="top">Super cool. No pun intended, really. Nice processing to play with the light. Great stuff.</td>', 'Super cool. No pun intended, really. Nice processing to play with the light. Great stuff.', '2014-02-05 00:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169824, 1100895, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Well done on the processing as well, to bring out rich colors that enhance the mood. Great stuff.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Well done on the processing as well, to bring out rich colors that enhance the mood. Great stuff.', '2014-02-05 00:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169825, 1100510, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well seen and perfectly done. What an interesting photo.</td>', 'Well seen and perfectly done. What an interesting photo.', '2014-02-05 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169832, 1101367, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Very well composed, lovely subtle colors, soothing. Great stuff.</td>', 'Nicely done. Very well composed, lovely subtle colors, soothing. Great stuff.', '2014-02-05 00:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169838, 1101237, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent patterns and textures. Great colors and toning. Sweet photo.</td>', 'Excellent patterns and textures. Great colors and toning. Sweet photo.', '2014-02-05 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169844, 1101453, 108069, '<td valign="top">Pretty incredible. Amazing depth. When you look at the detail in the point it''s so vivid that it almost appears to be a tilt-shift photo. Perfectly composed and executed. It''s really amazing.</td>', 'Pretty incredible. Amazing depth. When you look at the detail in the point it''s so vivid that it almost appears to be a tilt-shift photo. Perfectly composed and executed. It''s really amazing.', '2014-02-05 00:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169850, 1101496, 69450, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been great if you had included some of the shore in the frame. Without it, there''s no reference point so it just looks like you pointed the camera into the sky and took a non-landscape shot.</td>', 'I think this would have been great if you had included some of the shore in the frame. Without it, there''s no reference point so it just looks like you pointed the camera into the sky and took a non-landscape shot.', '2014-02-05 00:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169857, 1100449, 69450, '<td valign="top">I can see where you used the brush tool to paint out highlights. If you''re going to do that, you should always sample a nearby color, rather than choose black.</td>', 'I can see where you used the brush tool to paint out highlights. If you''re going to do that, you should always sample a nearby color, rather than choose black.', '2014-02-05 00:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7169866, 1101172, 69450, '<td valign="top">This would be better if you had cropped out the roofline and the door, and then straightened the horizon. It would have been cool and kind of funny.</td>', 'This would be better if you had cropped out the roofline and the door, and then straightened the horizon. It would have been cool and kind of funny.', '2014-02-05 00:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
