(7174338, 1101346, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully expressive image that easily carries its immense sky.  The orange streak of low-lying clouds elegantly informs this picture''s minimalism with personality. The curiously split tree embracing the sunset and the lone person add even more interest.  The light is deftly captured.  Most satisfying.</td>', 'Wonderfully expressive image that easily carries its immense sky.  The orange streak of low-lying clouds elegantly informs this picture''s minimalism with personality. The curiously split tree embracing the sunset and the lone person add even more interest.  The light is deftly captured.  Most satisfying.', '2014-02-10 22:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7174348, 1101312, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautifully colored yet extremely minimal image.  The road and post are perfectly placed, and the green area of the foreground adds proper weight.  Quite stunning.</td>', 'A beautifully colored yet extremely minimal image.  The road and post are perfectly placed, and the green area of the foreground adds proper weight.  Quite stunning.', '2014-02-10 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
