(7174663, 1100510, 173844, '<td valign="top">This well-titled image toys with our perceptions, adding a bonus gloss to the otherwise minimalist portrayal with water and sky flickering back and forth.  Enjoyably playful.</td>', 'This well-titled image toys with our perceptions, adding a bonus gloss to the otherwise minimalist portrayal with water and sky flickering back and forth.  Enjoyably playful.', '2014-02-11 16:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7174668, 1101507, 173844, '<td valign="top">The foreground wedge of land, with brush and trees, darts into an extremely minimal landscape providing a simple focus, enough to offer visual moorage to the viewer. Don''t know if that makes any sense, but I do like this photo.  It has an old time feel to it.</td>', 'The foreground wedge of land, with brush and trees, darts into an extremely minimal landscape providing a simple focus, enough to offer visual moorage to the viewer. Don''t know if that makes any sense, but I do like this photo.  It has an old time feel to it.', '2014-02-11 16:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7174669, 1101351, 102278, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and compelling composition. Sparks off plenty of narrative for me as well.  Fantastic. One of my top three favourites of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'Fascinating and compelling composition. Sparks off plenty of narrative for me as well.  Fantastic. One of my top three favourites of the challenge. 10.', '2014-02-11 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7174670, 1101172, 102278, '<td valign="top">Hell of a journey. I love everything about it - the expanse of icy foreground, the wonderfully orange brick wall, the ominous door and hopeful traveller. Excellent. One of my top three favourites of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'Hell of a journey. I love everything about it - the expanse of icy foreground, the wonderfully orange brick wall, the ominous door and hopeful traveller. Excellent. One of my top three favourites of the challenge. 10.', '2014-02-11 16:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7174671, 1100635, 102278, '<td valign="top">Lovely creeping mist and the emerging buildings on either side are a dream. Love it. One of my top three favourites of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'Lovely creeping mist and the emerging buildings on either side are a dream. Love it. One of my top three favourites of the challenge. 10.', '2014-02-11 16:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
