(7174674, 1101476, 102278, '<td valign="top">A very compelling landscape. Love the addition of the moon/sun and the juxtaposition of it with the tower. One of my favourites. 9.</td>', 'A very compelling landscape. Love the addition of the moon/sun and the juxtaposition of it with the tower. One of my favourites. 9.', '2014-02-11 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
