(7174847, 1101447, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gotta love that mist!  I suspect the sky may have been manipulated a bit to get that color, but it is gorgeous that way.  Love the bits of grass poking up through the snow, too.  Wonderful vista, very much meets the challenge.</td>', 'Gotta love that mist!  I suspect the sky may have been manipulated a bit to get that color, but it is gorgeous that way.  Love the bits of grass poking up through the snow, too.  Wonderful vista, very much meets the challenge.', '2014-02-11 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
